# Concern edgecase (7pj)

Before claiming a **list / tab / save** done, walk this list. Find the miss. Do **not** add guess fallbacks (`14-code-must-benefit`).

## Check (must)

| Edge | Fail looks like |
|---|---|
| PAI v2 omits nested (commission / RI) | Tab empty; DB has rows |
| `isBurglaryProductCode` skip of GET that 0121 still uses | 7pj empty; 0121 OK |
| Edit hydrate vs tab load | Props `[]` overwrite a good GET |
| Endt `data_id` vs policy v2 URL | GET 404/500 on endt tab |
| Late `productCode` / `dataId` on mount | First paint skips load |
| GET fail | Spinner then wipe filled rows |
| Scale | Share 0.52 in DB vs 52 on form; PAI wants **percent** |
| Silent default | `000` / `?? ''` on required API fields |

## Do

- Match **0121 path** when 7pj should show the same table (Eloquent / local), not a new skip.
- One portal for the same hydrate gap (edit **or** tab GET, not fighting each other).
- 0121–0125: no drive-by.

## Don't

- Extra 422 dumps / `a ?? b ?? c` “just in case”.
- Narration comments.
- Change generate SQL product filters when config already has 0189 / 0191–0196 / 0206.
